---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-05 - Forgot and Reset Password
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AuthController
    participant S as AccountService
    participant E as IEmailService
    participant H as IPasswordHasher
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    U->>W: Enter email on "Forgot password"
    W->>C: POST /api/Auth/forgot-password {email}
    C->>S: ForgotPasswordAsync(request)
    S->>R: Find active, linked account by email
    opt account found
        S->>S: Store hash of a new token, expiry = now + 1 hour
        S->>R: UpdateAsync(account)
        R->>DB: UPDATE ACCOUNTS
        S->>E: SendPasswordResetEmailAsync(email, fullName, token)
    end
    S-->>C: Same reply in every case
    C-->>W: 200 OK
    U->>W: Open link and enter the new password
    W->>C: POST /api/Auth/reset-password {token, newPassword, confirmPassword}
    C->>S: ResetPasswordAsync(request)
    S->>R: Find account by token hash (not expired)
    S->>H: Hash(newPassword)
    S->>R: PrepareUpdate account (new hash, token cleared), end every active session
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE ACCOUNTS, SESSIONS
    S-->>C: ResetPasswordResponse
    C-->>W: 200 OK
